sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Operator
  participant C as Client (web / mobile)
  participant R as ChunkedRecorder
  participant B as Backend (Express)
  participant G as Google Drive
  participant M as SMTP
  actor E as Recipients (≤ 3)

  U->>C: enter up to 3 emails
  U->>C: press Record
  C->>R: start(stream, maxChunkSeconds=1800)
  loop every ≤ 30 min
    R-->>R: MediaRecorder fills buffer
    Note over R: timer fires OR user stops
    R->>C: onChunk(blob, index)
    C->>B: POST /api/recordings (multipart)
    B->>G: files.create + permissions.create(anyone:reader)
    G-->>B: {fileId, webViewLink}
    B->>M: sendMail(to: recipients, link)
    M-->>E: email with Drive link
    B-->>C: {driveWebViewLink, emailedTo}
  end
  U->>C: press Stop
  C->>R: stop()
  R-->>C: final onChunk(...)
  Note over C,B: same upload+email path as above
